        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Works: Portofino\n- People: Richard Ney, Sheldon Harnick, Louis Bellson, Will Irwin, Jerry Bock\n- Roles: book writers, lyricists, composers\n- Topics: musicals\n\nFacts:\n- Sheldon Harnick was born on April 30, 1924.\n- Sheldon Harnick is an American lyricist.\n- Sheldon Harnick is best known for collaborating with composer Jerry Bock on musicals such as \"Fiddler on the Roof\".\n- Portofino is a musical.\n- Richard Ney wrote the book for Portofino.\n- Richard Ney and Sheldon Harnick wrote the lyrics for Portofino.\n- Louis Bellson and Will Irwin composed the music for Portofino.",
